00:16:21,329 --> 00:16:26,164
And I want to spend the days
talking.

291
00:16:26,166 --> 00:16:30,436
- And the nights?
- We'll spend those together, too.

292
00:16:32,761 --> 00:16:35,540
I want us to be lovers, Mary.

