00:16:35,542 --> 00:16:38,476
What do you say to
my scandalous suggestion?

294
00:16:38,478 --> 00:16:42,047
Oh, my,
what will Lady Mary say?

295
00:16:42,049 --> 00:16:45,984
If she agrees,
this has scandal written all over it.

296
00:16:45,986 --> 00:16:48,223
I love it.

