00:19:06,493 --> 00:19:08,429
He's served in the army.
He's fought in the World War,

335
00:19:08,453 --> 00:19:11,863
but he's never really experienced life
beyond the estate.

336
00:19:11,865 --> 00:19:16,134
So his destiny really is to
