365
00:20:51,625 --> 00:20:54,757
so much so that years earlier,
Robert was forced to find

366
00:20:54,769 --> 00:21:00,271
an American heiress to save the day,
Cora Levinson.

367
00:21:00,273 --> 00:21:04,906
She has saved his bacon,
and that's why when he loses her money,

368
00:21:04,930 --> 00:21:07,011
this is just the
worst possible nightmare

369
00:21:07,012 --> 00:21:10,549
because he should
never have had the money anyway,

370
00:21:10,561 --> 00:21:17,611
you know, he took her
