00:23:31,601 --> 00:23:33,057
Poor Robert.

411
00:23:33,081 --> 00:23:35,552
The new world is challenging him
in so many ways,

412
00:23:35,564 --> 00:23:38,129
and he has trouble
moving with the tide.

